{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10416","headline":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 十二 · 高适","name":"自淇涉黄河途中作十三首 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝景入平川，川长复垂柳。\n遥看魏公墓，突兀前山後。\n忆昔大业时，羣雄角奔走。\n伊人何电迈，独立风尘首。\n传檄举敖仓，拥兵屯洛口。\n连营一百万，六合如可有。\n方项终比肩，乱隋将假手。\n力争固难恃，骄战曷能久。\n若使学萧曹，功名当不朽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}